$$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's apply the operations to each of the matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}6 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 6 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & \\ne I\\,\\times  \\\\ B & =[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & \\ne I\\,\\times  \\\\ C & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & ↔{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-3){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =I\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$C$ only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345097 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115251 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "77d78574-a17c-5fc3-8c14-3aaec7753b3c" :knowledge-point/title "Transforming a 2x2 Matrix Into the Identity Matrix Using Row Operations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d1c880af-d051-51c9-ab73-b924750b1cef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468130} {:answer/id #uuid "4a2d43d5-9944-5ac0-83bd-d8335f6bd1bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468131}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "4a2d43d5-9944-5ac0-83bd-d8335f6bd1bc" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468131} :answer-field/id #uuid "7ade3324-e3b7-5e64-9d8e-2b78898e0777" :answer-field/key "A" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.