c{1}{4}{R}_{1}\\,$ and $\\,{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1}?$\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,C=[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "Let's apply the operations to each of the matrices:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{4}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -3 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =I\\,✓ \\\\ B & =[\\begin{aligned}8 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{4}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ -6 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}2 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & \\ne I\\,\\times  \\\\ C & =[\\begin{aligned}4 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :=\\frac{1}{4}{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+3{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & \\ne I\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"$A$ only\"."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186345106 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115251 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "77d78574-a17c-5fc3-8c14-3aaec7753b3c" :knowledge-point/title "Transforming a 2x2 Matrix Into the Identity Matrix Using Row Operations"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9a22d4b7-074a-5d04-912d-7b6108e7167d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468136} {:answer/id #uuid "5d0b2a23-76ab-5200-8d7b-f13b77b40192" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186468137}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9a22d4b7-074a-5d04-912d-7b6108e7167d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/r